<view class="{{['data-v-2508add4', 'container', m]}}"><view class="page-shell solar-shell data-v-2508add4"><view class="page-header solar-header data-v-2508add4"><text class="title data-v-2508add4">🌾 二十四节气</text><text class="subtitle data-v-2508add4">查询全年节气日期、季节变化和养生提示</text></view><view class="summary-card card data-v-2508add4"><view class="data-v-2508add4"><text class="summary-label data-v-2508add4">当前日期</text><text class="summary-date data-v-2508add4">{{a}}</text></view><picker class="data-v-2508add4" mode="date" value="{{b}}" bindchange="{{c}}"><view class="date-switch data-v-2508add4">切换日期</view></picker></view><view class="highlight-grid data-v-2508add4"><view wx:if="{{d}}" class="highlight-card card data-v-2508add4"><text class="highlight-label data-v-2508add4">当前节气</text><text class="highlight-title data-v-2508add4">{{e}}</text><text class="highlight-desc data-v-2508add4">{{f}} · {{g}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{h}}" class="highlight-card card data-v-2508add4"><text class="highlight-label data-v-2508add4">下一个节气</text><text class="highlight-title data-v-2508add4">{{i}}</text><text class="highlight-desc data-v-2508add4">{{j}} · {{k}}</text></view></view><view class="term-list card data-v-2508add4"><view wx:for="{{l}}" wx:for-item="term" wx:key="i" class="{{['term-card', 'data-v-2508add4', term.g && 'active', term.h && 'next']}}"><view class="term-date data-v-2508add4"><text class="term-month data-v-2508add4">{{term.a}}月</text><text class="term-day data-v-2508add4">{{term.b}}</text></view><view class="term-info data-v-2508add4"><text class="term-name data-v-2508add4">{{term.c}}</text><text class="term-season data-v-2508add4">{{term.d}}季 · 第 {{term.e}} 个节气</text><text class="term-desc data-v-2508add4">{{term.f}}</text></view></view></view><view class="note-card card data-v-2508add4"><text class="note-title data-v-2508add4">说明</text><text class="note-text data-v-2508add4">节气日期采用常用近似日期，适合日常查询参考；精确交节时刻请以天文历法为准。</text></view></view></view>